  "content": "<p>此模組屬於[地牢與酒館](<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-and-taverns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-and-taverns</a>)系列，但**無需**安裝地牢與酒館即可運作。主要的地牢與酒館模組**並未包含**此模組的功能。如果您想要更多類似的結構，請查看[我的個人檔案！](<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nova_wostra/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nova_wostra/projects</a>)</p><p>- 徹底改造叢林神廟，提供4種變體<br>- 此處預設生成4隻沼骸怪<br>- 新增戰利品表，與原版戰利品並存<br>- 其中2種叢林神廟變體採用考古系統<br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/39a322cb5ff76acc88b1eb4508e5f9188fb77bc9.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/3932aa4174b49f395e39e1393f9871c3f582c2c5.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/4dd9e156769742b7019b08f2443ca34cb156ad7e.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/30df97e0c9788cb114690f3beb01eaaef96427c1.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/3ce1dd35d40ab23f86fce028c02c85f0075faf4a.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/oHjYCS0f/images/5b46c6023261e16e5375f49e7460435872d7ed4a.png\"></p>",
